msgid "No pude apartar el sistema actual"
msgstr "Couldn't move the current system aside"

#: fotos/fotos:197
msgid "No pude poner la foto en su sitio (no ha cambiado nada)"
msgstr "Couldn't put the snapshot in place (nothing has changed)"

